r `retval`. In the second round, if new itens were found, free is used on `retval` and the loop returns to round 1. The only way to exit the loop with `retval` freed is if `failed` is set to `true` and the break at line 5202 is reached. `retval` will be freed at that moment only if it has been freed at line 5167, but for `failed` to be true after that can only happen at line 5182 requiring `id` to be 0. However if `retval` was freed at line 5167 `id` will then be -1.\nThat way when the loop exits `retval` wont be freed.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/67758969/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"victorfonsec4","id":1757467,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTc0Njc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1757467?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorfonsec4","html_url":"https://github.com/victorfonsec4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorfonsec4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorfonsec4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorfonsec4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorfonsec4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorfonsec4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorfonsec4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorfonsec4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorfonsec4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorfonsec4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/67981912","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/1682#issuecomment-67981912","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/rep